    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense. I'll make sure we specify the exact coverage amount in the contract. Just one more thing—what happens if the goods are damaged due to something totally unpredictable during the voyage? If the insurance doesn't cover a specific type of incident, who ends up bearing that loss under CIF?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
